Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Pinned, unmodified source modules and reproducibly generated resource data.
Seoul preserves execution-world and requiresTrust metadata. Subscription rules
receive no trusted permissions; privileged scriptlets remain unavailable until
a separately verified rule source is integrated. No executable code is fetched
at runtime. The resource pack and corresponding sources retain the upstream
license and copyright; distribution must include these notices and sources.
